# Changelog (milestone ship)

**Scope:** Engineering milestones only. Routine commits do **not** get **Shipped** entries.

**Source of truth:** checklist under [Now](docs/roadmap.md#now) in `docs/roadmap.md`.

## When to run

Apply when the user says **ship milestone**, **update changelog**, **complete M#**, **ship**, or similar.

**Agents:** When every **Now** checkbox is `[x]`, run this in the **same turn** (before you say the milestone is done)—including when **review staged** / **review branch** catches a finished **Now** without CHANGELOG / advanced **Now** (fix in the working tree; user re-stages).

Otherwise do not edit `CHANGELOG.md`.

## What to write (same commit or PR as the milestone work)

1. **`CHANGELOG.md`** — Under **Shipped**, add `### MN — …` (short form, newest first). Bullets match the completed **Now** checklist.
2. **`docs/roadmap.md`** — Replace **Now** with the next milestone from **Upcoming**.
